Package: RUVprps
Title: Removing Unwanted Variation Using Pseudo-Replicates of Pseudo-Samples
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Ramyar", "Molania", email="molania.r@wehi.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Normalization of RNA sequencing data using removing unwanted
    variation III (RUV-III) with pseudo-replicates of pseudo-samples (PRPS).
    Provides supervised and unsupervised selection of negative control genes,
    construction of pseudo-replicates, normalization, and assessment of biological
    signal preservation and unwanted variation removal. The method is described
    by Molania et al. (2023) <doi:10.1038/s41587-022-01440-w>.
    Optional packages available outside standard repositories are 'kBET'
    <https://github.com/theislab/kBET>, 'lisi'
    <https://github.com/immunogenomics/LISI>, and 'CMScaller'
    <https://github.com/Lothelab/CMScaller>.
